      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FRIDA SCIENCE (1) was safely held in tougher company last start after being shuffled back early at this track, but prior to that won by 0.8 lengths at Traralgon (20.33) beating Hot Honey in a T3 Grade 7 on August 31. Has ability and can bounce back. NIGHTMARE GAVIN (3) goes very well at the distance with two wins and a placing from five starts. Was out of placings last time (17.17) at this track in a Mix 6/7, finishing eighth and beaten 5.5 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. MCCREERY (2) turned in a solid run last start over 300m at this track finishing 4th and beaten only 4 lengths (17.31). Solid formlines coming through his last run. Has the ability to give this a shake. SAFELY (4) was a winner two back then strongly fancied last time but could only manage a third (19.79) at this track. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box.",
